+  // "findAttrPath" reconstructs an option path by walking the enclosing
+  // attribute sets. That is right for NixOS/Home-Manager modules, but breaks
+  // down whenever configuration is assigned to a *nested* attribute path with no
+  // intervening function -- the dendritic layout used by this project:
+  //
+  //     users.ar175.nixos.pc = {
+  //       time.timeZone = "Asia/Almaty";
+  //     };
+  //
+  // "users.ar175.nixos.pc" is the module's own plumbing rather than part of the
+  // option path, so the reconstructed scope becomes
